# Netlist gate: every field of the pipeline register must have a driver.  The
# write that FOLLOWS the zero-trip inner loop was dropped because the body was
# handed to the compile-time interpreter, which emits no sync writes: `check`
# reports 20 undriven bits (ptr + activeListPtr of both elements), and the
# output that reads `ptr` goes undriven with them.
read_uhdm slpp_all/surelog.uhdm
hierarchy -check -top sync_nested_zero_trip_loop_write
proc; opt_clean
check -assert
